 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Yet Hashiki was still searching for issues.": "",
  "Still... Hashiki was intent on\nsearching for a liability.": "",
  "And if he had managed to find one...": "",
  "The ADDC would be long gone by now.": "",
  "Then they murdered Hashiki\nto keep the secret safe?": "",
  "Then... they murdered Hashiki\nto keep the secret safe?": "",
  "Don't be ridiculous. Who would kill a man\njust to protect a research paper?": "",
  "No. Who would kill a man just to\nprotect a research paper?": "",
  "It might not be as unlikely as you think.": "",
  "It might not be that unlikely.": "",
  "The ADDC has been bringing in billions of government\nyen ever since they published that paper.": "",
  "Ever since their paper on AD-9, the ADDC has been\nbringing in millions of government yen.": "",
  "With that much cash involved, bumping someone off\nwouldn't be out of the question.": "",
  "With that much cash involved,\nbumping someone off wouldn't be out of the question.": "",
  "The question is, who killed Hashiki?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The culprit made it so Hashiki wouldn't die immediately.\nHe had to be pretty skilled.)</color>": "",
  "A professional assassin,\nif I had to guess.": "",
  "If I had to guess,\nI'd say a professional assassin.": "",
  "The man in the black raincoat.": "",
  "The man in the black raincoat...": "",
  "If he was an assassin,\nthat would mean someone hired him.": "",
  "If he was an assassin,\nsomeone must have hired him.": "",
  "Yeah. Someone who wanted to protect\nAD-9 and the ADDC.": "",
  "But who...?": "",
  "Question is, who...?": "",
  "Can't begin to imagine.": "",
  "But apparently Kido was out hyping up AD-9.\nRaking in tons of dirty money in the process.": "",
  "But... apparently Kido was out hyping up AD-9,\nraking in tons of dirty money in the process.": "",
  "Guy might even be\ninvolved with the yakuza.": "",
  "The guy might even be\nin with the yakuza.": "",
  "You're really suspicious\nof him, Yagami-san.": "",
  "You're really suspicious of him,\nYagami-san.": "",
  "Well, if it looks like a rat...": "",
  "Where there's dust, there's dirt.": "",
  "Maybe Shintani got too close to the truth...\nand Kido offed him for it.": "",
  "Maybe it was the same for Shintani. He got too close\nto the truth... and Kido killed him for it.": "",
  "The thought has crossed my mind.": "",
  "Don't think we can say that for sure without\nlooking more into Kido, though.": "",
  "Still, we can't say that for sure.\nNot without looking deeper into Kido.": "",
  "But... judging from our last visit,\nthat won't be as easy as you make it sound.": "",
  "He's practically a celebrity at this point.": "",
  "At this point, he's practically\na celebrity.": "",
  "Well... maybe if we can't get him to talk,\nthe prosecutor's office can.": "",
  "Yeah. Well... if <font_kind=yakuza_italic>we</font_kind> can't get him to talk,\nmaybe the prosecutor's office can.": "",
  "I've got a meeting with Izumida tomorrow.\nThey're calling me in.": "",
  "Tomorrow, I've got a meeting\nlined up with Izumida.": "",
  "Isn't that the prosecutor who was\ntrying to get you arrested?": "",
  "Izumida, the prosecutor? But if I recall...\nIsn't that the guy who was trying to arrest you...?": "",
  "He can try all he wants.\nThat's what this meeting's about.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Is</font_kind> trying.\nThat's why he wants to talk.": "",
  "No chance in hell he agrees\nto help us, then.": "",
  "If the prosecutor's gunning for you,\nno chance in hell he agrees to help us.": "",
  "All depends on how this little chat goes.": "",
  "That depends on how\nthat chat of ours goes.": "",
  "If I can convince him I'm innocent, I'll clear my name\nand put the squeeze on Kido all in one fell swoop.": "",
  "If I can convince him I'm innocent... I'll clear my name\nand put the squeeze on Kido.": "",
  "What are you planning, Yagami-san...?": "",
  "But how?\nWhat are you planning...?": "",
  "Yo. Everything's really fallin' into place.": "",
  "Yo. Everything's really fallin'\ninto place.": "",
  "Guess it's good we let Saori-san\nhandle the cabaret, huh?": "",
  "You can talk to Izumida tomorrow,\nbut you better not get arrested over there!": "",
  "Promise me!": "",
  "I feel like we did good work today.": "",
  "Nice work out there today.": "",
  "Go home and relax, Yagami-san.\nYou have a big day tomorrow.": "",
  "Go home and relax, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Dunno if I should be saying this, but it's been\na while since I've felt this alive.": "",
  "Dunno if I should be saying this, but all the same...\nit's been a while since I've felt this alive.": "",
  "This case is just about reaching its tipping point.\nI'd be out there too if my knees weren't so damn creaky.": "",
  "This case is just about reaching its tipping point.\nI'd be out there too, if my knees weren't so damn creaky.": "",
  "Got a message for you from Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Says to drop by the Tokyo Public Prosecutor's Office.\nIzumida's waiting for you.": "",
  "Why'd you have to come here to tell me that?\nWould've been easier to talk on the phone.": "",
  "You had to sneak in here to tell me that?\nThat's why we have phones.": "",
  "I got a bad feeling about all this.": "",
  "...I got a bad feeling about all this.": "",
  "Feels like I'm never gonna see you again\nif you get yourself locked up now.": "",
  "If you get yourself locked up now,\nsomething tells me I might never see you again.": "",
  "C'mon, don't be like that.": "",
  "Even if I do get arrested,\nI won't say a word about your little side job.": "",
  "And even if I do get arrested,\nI won't say a word about your little side job.": "",
  "That's what you're worried about, right?": "",
  "Yup. I might have to send someone to bump you off\nin prison if you rat me out.": "",
  "Yup. If you rat me out, I might have to\nsend someone to bump you off in prison.": "",
  "Like you could pull that off.\nAren't you busy dusting off Kuroiwa's boots?": "",
  "Sure, like you could pull that off.\nYou're just Kuroiwa's errand boy these days.": "",
  "I'm laying low, that's all.": "",
  "Speaking of. I have a question for you\nnow that you're off your leash.": "",
  "While you're off Kuroiwa's leash,\nmaybe you can answer something.": "",
  "Why do they think I killed Shintani?\nThey have to have a reason, right?": "",
  "Why do they think I killed Shintani?\nThey have to have a reason, don't they?": "",
  "You've gotta know.": "",
  "You've gotta know something, right?": "",
  "Well funny enough, I don't.": "",
  "Nope. Funny enough, I don't.": "",
  "Kuroiwa won't share a shred of info with anyone\nbut his closest partners. Not sure why.": "",
  "Truth is, Kuroiwa won't share a shred of info with anyone\nbut his closest partners. Not sure why.": "",
  "Now get over to the prosecutor's office.\nSorry, but you gotta cover your own cab fare.": "",
  "Now get over to the prosecutor's office.\nSorry, but we can't pay your cab fare.": "",
  "Yeah, I know.": "",
  "Wasn't expecting you to...": "",
  "I've been waiting for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Rolling out the red carpet, huh?": "",
  "Izumida was hoping you'd lower your guard\nif I was the first person you saw here.": "",
  "Seeing me might make you lower your guard.\nOr so Izumida hoped.": "",
  "The man never changes.\nHe loves his mind games.": "",
  "That guy and his mind games.\nHe never changes.": "",
  "This way.": "",
  "Y'know, I've never been allowed up\nhere before.": "",
  "Yagami-kun.\nHow did they convince you to come?": "",
  "Yagami-kun, how did they\nconvince you to come?": "",
  "I heard your pal, Izumida, wants to chat.": "",
  "Oh, your pal Izumida\njust wants to chat, apparently.": "",
  "And depending on what I say,\nhe may or may not try to arrest me.": "",
  "And depending on what I say,\nhe may or may not arrest me.": "",
  "Hm... I'm not sure it'll\nbe quite like that.": "",
  "Hm... You think?\nI'm not sure you have that right.": "",
  "Huh? Then what's it gonna be!?": "",
  "No? Then what's it gonna be?": "",
  "Well... you're about to get\nthrown to the wolves.": "",
  "Hey, Mafuyu!": "",
  "Hey, come on...": "",
  "Good luck.": "",
  "Excuse me.\nI've brought Yagami-san.": "",
  "Much appreciated.": "",
  "Huh. Even the chief prosecutor's\nin on this.": "",
  "The chief prosecutor too, huh?": "",
  "Please, come in.": "",
  "After you.": "",
  "So these are the wolves.": "",
  "I get it. These are the wolves.": "",
  "A room full of prosecutors, huh?": "",
  "You're all prosecutors, huh?": "",
  "I believe Kuroiwa-san already told you this,\nbut we want to talk to you about Shintani-sensei's murder.": "",
  "However, this is not a courtroom.": "",
  "And we're not strangers.\nOr wolves. Just try to relax.": "",
  "And we're not strangers. Or wolves.\nWe're just here for a little chat.": "",
  "Yeah, relax. Right.": "",
  "Some \"little chat.\"": "",
  "I'm not telling you what\nyou wanna hear, though.": "",
  "Just so you know,\nI'm not giving you anything good today.": "",
  "You want me to say I killed Shintani, right?\nSorry. Not happening.": "",
  "You want me to tell you I killed Shintani,\nbut that's not happening.": "",
  "The burden of proof's on you, anyway.": "",
  "So why don't we start there?\nWhy do you think I did it?": "",
  "So why do you think I killed Shintani?\nWhy don't we start with some logic?": "",
  "...Yagami-sensei. Where were you on the night\nof Shintani-sensei's murder?": "",
  "Where were you on the night of Shintani-sensei's murder?\nWhat were you doing, Yagami-sensei?": "",
  "Answer my question with another question?\nNow that's not very nice.": "",
  "Do you have an alibi for that evening?": "",
  "You heard of a company called KJ Art? The place is\na front for some Kansai yakuza. The Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "The Kyorei yakuza have a base around here.\nIt's in a building for KJ Art.": "",
  "On the night of the crime,\nI was near there with their captain, Shioya.": "",
  "On the night of the crime, I was near there with\ntheir captain, Shioya.": "",
  "He'll back my story up, I'm sure.": "",
  "He'll back up my alibi, I'm sure.": "",
  "Then care to explain why Shintani-sensei's\ncorpse was found in your office?": "",
  "Then, care to explain why Shintani-sensei's corpse\nwas found in your office?": "",
  "I was hoping you could tell me.": "",
  "That's what I'd like to know.": "",
  "Maybe the real killer\ncould answer that for you.": "",
  "You should be asking the killer that.": "",
  "Naturally. That's why I called you here.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Dammit. They had no intention of listening to\nwhat I had to say from the start.)</color>": "",
  "Mind if I interject?": "",
  "May I interject?": "",
  "Go right ahead, Morita-san.": "",
  "Your floor, Prosecutor Morita.": "",
  "Yagami-san. You stole a look at Shintani-sensei's\ncall history before the police arrived, yes?": "",
  "Yagami-san. You stole a look at\nShintani-sensei's call history, yes?": "",
  "Not long before his death, he placed a call\nto the Advanced Drug Development Center.": "",
  "Not long before Shintani-san's death, he placed a call\nto the Advanced Drug Development Center.": "",
  "Knowing that, you barged into the Center\nand interrogated both Kido-san and Shono-san.": "",
  "Based on that information, you barged into the Center,\nand interrogated both Kido-san and Shono-san.": "",
  "Why would you do such a thing?": "",
  "I wanted to figure out what made\nShintani a target. Who wanted him dead.": "",
  "I wanted to find out why Shintani died.\nFigured I was on my own.": "",
  "Is that not the police's job?": "",
  "I couldn't leave it to them,\nor the prosecution.": "",
  "I couldn't leave it to them\nor the prosecution.": "",
  "After all, you guys have a bad habit of going\nafter the wrong guy. Kinda like right now.": "",
  "You guys tend to chase down the wrong guys.\nKinda like right now.": "",
  "I see. So you mean to imply\nsomeone else killed Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "I see.\nYou're saying someone else killed him?": "",
  "Do you have anything that\ncould prove that claim?": "",
  "Can you prove that claim?": "",
  "You want proof, I think I can find it.": "",
  "If that's what you want.\nI'll do it.": "",
  "This better not be a waste of time.": "",
  "Funny, I could have said the same thing\nwhen you dragged me in here.": "",
  "After you dragged me in here,\nI could say the same.": "",
  "...Yes. Please begin.": "",
  "...Fine, go ahead. You can begin.": "",
  "The burden of proof rests\non the prosecution.": "",
  "That sounds an awful lot like\nwhat you should be doing.": "",
  "It's not my place to take on such\na heavy responsibility.": "",
  "The burden of proof is far\ntoo heavy for me to bear.": "",
  "There's no need to be like that, Yagami-san.\nAs we said before, this isn't a courtroom.": "",
  "There's no need to be like that.\nAs we said, this isn't a courtroom.": "",
  "It'd be an honor to hear your\nthoughts on the matter.": "",
  "I would be honored to hear your thoughts\non the matter.": "",
  "Yeah? How about someone says please?": "",
  "Yeah? Then start with \"please\" next time.": "",
  "...Please.": "",
  "Great. I'll tell you what I know.": "",
  "That's the only reason I'm here.": "",
  "Oh? How responsible of you.": "",
  "The prosecution's proven unreliable, after all.\nI've been working my ass off 'cause of you guys.": "",
  "The prosecution's proven unreliable, after all.\nYou guys are making me work my ass off.": "",
  "Now, can we begin?": "",
  "Shall I get started?": "",
  "Yes, you have the floor, Yagami.": "",
  "Yes, do enlighten us.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is to my benefit, too. This way,\nI can find out how the prosecution sees Shintani's case.)</color>": "",
  "Before we get to Shintani's murder,\nthere are a few things I need to cover.": "",
  "Now, there are a couple things I need to cover\nbefore we get to Shintani's murder.": "",
  "One year ago, the ADDC published a research paper\non a new drug they were developing called AD-9. ": "",
  "One year ago, the ADDC published a research paper\non a new drug they were developing called AD-9.": "",
  "This drug has gained global recognition as\nthe thing that may finally cure Alzheimer's disease.": "",
  "This drug has gained global recognition\nas a potential end to Alzheimer's disease.": "",
  "What hasn't gained recognition is the fact\nthat someone from the ADDC was murdered six months ago.": "",
  "What hasn't gained recognition is the fact that\nsix months ago, someone from the ADDC was murdered.": "",
  "An ADDC member murdered? Who?": "",
  "An ADDC member murdered?\nWho?": "",
  "A nurse by the name of Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "A nurse at the ADDC.\nEmi Terasawa.": "",
  "Come on. Emi died three years ago,\nnot six months.": "",
  "Come on. Emi died three years ago,\nnot in the last six months.": "",
  "I'd think you of all people would remember that.\nSeems you're not as sharp as I thought.": "",
  "You of all people should remember that.\nYou're losing your edge.": "",
  "The ADDC employee who got murdered was...": "",
  "The ADDC employee who\ngot murdered was...": "",
  "A researcher by the name of Yoji Shono.": "",
  "A researcher by the name\nof Yoji Shono.": "",
  "Wait, he was murdered? When?": "",
  "He was murdered?\nReally? When?": "",
  "Hm? Wait, you're right.\nHe's still alive.": "",
  "Hm? Wait... right. He's still alive.": "",
  "...Let me know when you're ready\nto stop wasting my time.": "",
  "...Are you done wasting my time yet?": "",
  "Sorry, all these people are making me nervous.\nGive me another chance.": "",
  "Starting over.\nThe ADDC employee who got murdered was...": "",
  "The director, Ryusuke Kido.": "",
  "...He's still alive.": "",
  "Nobody murdered Director Kido.": "",
  "Oh... right.\nHold on a sec.": "",
  "The vice director, Toru Hashiki.": "",
  "Hashiki was seen arguing with a strange man in Kamurocho\nbefore being found lying beaten in the street.": "",
  "Hashiki was seen arguing with a strange man in Kamurocho,\nand was found afterwards lying in the street.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "C'mon, don't be like that.": "ไม่เอาน่า อย่าทำตัวแบบนั้นสิ",
  "Yeah, I know.": "ใช่ ฉันก็รู้",
  "This way.": "ทางนี้ค่ะ",
  "Hey, come on...": "เฮ้ย ไม่เอาน่า...",
  "Good luck.": "โชคดีนะครับ",
  "Much appreciated.": "ขอบคุณมากนะ",
  "After you.": "เชิญก่อนเลย",
  "That's what I'd like to know.": "นั่นคือสิ่งที่ผมอยากรู้เหมือนกันครับ",
  "That's the only reason I'm here.": "นั่นคือเหตุผลเดียวที่ฉันมาที่นี่"
 }
}
